# Website + CRM image library

Work only in `saas-mvp-funnel`. Never pull assets from Factory-Website-CRM.

## Hard constraints

- One file = one image (never multiple shots on one canvas)
- 1920×1080, horizontal, photorealistic
- No text, letters, numbers, captions, or file names inside the image
- No logos, brands, signs, watermarks, slogans
- No UI, interfaces, frames, collages, contact sheets, presentation boards
- No labels such as `hero.jpg` / `gallery-1.jpg` rendered onto the image

## Roles (each = separate generated file)

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `hero.jpg` | Facade or main selling exterior/hero shot |
| `gallery-1.jpg` | Interior or primary workflow |
| `gallery-2.jpg` | Second angle or additional service |
| `gallery-3.jpg` | Details, equipment, atmosphere |
| `og.jpg` | Strongest wide frame for social/site preview |

Generate each role as its own image. Never combine roles into one canvas.
